// Google Maps API Configuration
// 
// SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
// 1. Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (in the same directory)
// 2. Replace YOUR_API_KEY_HERE with your actual Google Maps API key
// 3. Get your API key from: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
//
// REQUIRED APIS (enable in Google Cloud Console):
// - Maps SDK for iOS
// - Maps SDK for Android  
// - Geocoding API
// - Places API
//
// The Secrets.xcconfig file is gitignored for security.

GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=YOUR_API_KEY_HERE

